0 - Hook} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 1 \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 You grab your audience\u8217?s attention. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
1 - Setup} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 2 to 62 \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 You introduce the problem and the characters around it. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
2.1 - Reaction} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 63 to 118 \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
