Symbolic stages}} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 These stages appeal to archetypal symbolism. Though almost subliminal, they{\i
ar}{\i
e} there, even if you don\u8217?t notice them at first. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
