 {\b
{\ul
Joker stages}} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 Joker stages introduce either relief or a touch of humor. Place them wherever they best serve the story. I use them to dissipate any excessive tension created by the most intense passages: \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
