The Hero becomes who he/she truly is.}} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
Description:} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 Time has passed. The Hero has achieved a new, mature self. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 He controls his powers, his flaw is transcended, and a new, serene aura surrounds him. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 This marks a contrast with the \u8220?diamond in the rough\u8221? the Hero was in stage 005. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
