 192 \u8211? Freedom to Live \par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\qc
 {\b
{\i
The Hero chooses a future.}} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
Description:} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 No matter what was achieved during the quest, the Ultimate Boon is always{\i
freedo}{\i
m}. It is the key to individuation, to be oneself, to become who we are supposed to become. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 What will the Hero choose to do when the world has no more impending demands? Well, he usually uses this freedom to continue doing what he does best. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
