{\qc
 193 \u8211? Final Bows \par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\qc
 {\b
{\i
The curtain is about to fall.}} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
Description:} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 Just before the end, many stories recount the destiny of the main characters. It\u8217?s like at the end of a theater play, when the actors come to the stage to salute and thank the audience. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 This farewell rounds the story up by returning to the place where the adventure started. It closes a cycle and reminds the audience how good a time they had. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
Examples:} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
{\i
Sta}}{\b
{\i
r}} {\b
{\i
War}}{\b
{\i
s}}{\b
:} Luke, Leia, Han, Chewbacca, C3PO, and R2D2 stand together in front of the applauding crowd, just like at the end of a theater performance. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
{\i
Th}}{\b
{\i
e}} {\b
{\i
Matri}}{\b
{\i
x}}{\b
:} We see the surviving heroes back in the Nebuchadnezzar: Neo, Trinity, Morpheus, and Tank. And we see the Matrix, too, in the form of that green computer screen. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
{\i
Harr}}{\b
{\i
y}} {\b
{\i
Potte}}{\b
{\i
r}}{\b
:} Dumbledore names the kids one by one as he awards last-minute points: Harry, Hermione, Ron, and Neville. We see the rest of the characters as they react to the speech. Everyone is there. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
{\i
Sideway}}{\b
{\i
s}}{\b
:} We hear Maya\u8217?s voice in the loving message she leaves in Miles answering machine. Miles is like pinot, and she is graduating as a wine grower\u8212?a symbolism that goes back to the central dialogue of the film, back in stage 120. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
{\i
Dodgebal}}{\b
{\i
l}}{\b
:} The friends are back in the gym. There is a painting of Patches O\u8217?Houlihan hanging on a wall. The movie started with a TV spot for Globo Gym, and it ends with a TV spot for Average Joe\u8217?s. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
