{\qc
 195 \u8211? The Actual End \par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\qc
 {\b
{\i
Your story arrives at the last paragraph, }} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\qc
 {\b
{\i
the last sentence, and the last word. }} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
Description:} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 Before writing the last paragraph, go read some poetry. Get inspired. Avoid corniness at all costs, but end with emotion. The end of the book will immensely influence the reader\u8217?s final opinion about it. Make it memorable. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
Examples:} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
{\i
Sta}}{\b
{\i
r}} {\b
{\i
War}}{\b
{\i
s}}{\b
:} The last \u8220?words\u8221? are left to R2D2 and Chewbacca: Beeps and growls. We don\u8217?t know what they mean, but we know they are joyous. Brilliant. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
{\i
Th}}{\b
{\i
e}} {\b
{\i
Matri}}{\b
{\i
x}}{\b
:} Neo looks at the camera and thanks the audience with the subtlest of smiles. He puts his signature sunglasses on and flies away. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
{\i
Harr}}{\b
{\i
y}} {\b
{\i
Potte}}{\b
{\i
r}}{\b
:} Harry\u8217?s son is worried that he might get put into Slytherin house. Harry reminds him that he was named Albus Severus Potter after two Headmasters of Hogwarts; one of them was a Slytherin, and the bravest man Harry knew. And the very last word of the whole story is \u8220?Ready.\u8221? I doubt there is a word that better represents Harry\u8217?s own bravery. \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
{\i
Sideway}}{\b
{\i
s}}{\b
:} Maya\u8217?s message ends, \u8220?Anyway, like I said, I really loved your novel. Don\u8217?t give up, Miles. Keep writing.\u8221? \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 {\b
{\i
Dodgebal}}{\b
{\i
l}}{\b
:} The greatest final words in a comedy, ever: \u8220?Fucking Chuck Norris!\u8221? \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
